### **Connection to Previous Learning:**
Your website now has professional HTML structure (Day 1), beautiful CSS styling (Day 2), interactive JavaScript features (Day 3), and a functional contact form with validation (Day 4). Today you'll enhance your contact form by adding dropdown menus and select options to collect more specific information from visitors.

### **Learning Objective:**
