### **Phase 2: Present (15 minutes)**

**HTML Select Elements and JavaScript Enhancement**

**What Are Dropdown Select Menus?**
HTML elements that present users with a list of predefined options to choose from, making forms more user-friendly and data more consistent.

**Basic HTML Select Syntax:**
```html
<select id="selectName">
    <option value="">Choose an option</option>
    <option value="option1">First Choice</option>
    <option value="option2">Second Choice</option>
    <option value="option3">Third Choice</option>
</select>
```

**Types of Select Inputs for Your Contact Form:**

**1. SINGLE SELECTION DROPDOWN**
```html
<select id="contactReason">
    <option value="">Why are you contacting me?</option>
    <option value="question">I have a question</option>
    <option value="collaboration">I want to collaborate</option>
    <option value="feedback">I want to give feedback</option>
    <option value="other">Other reason</option>
</select>
```

**2. MULTIPLE SELECTION (with size attribute)**
```html
