                <h2>Welcome to My Website</h2>
                <p>This is now a professional multi-page website!</p>
            </section>

            <!-- Move your existing content here -->
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <!-- Footer code from above -->
    </footer>

    <script src="js/script.js"></script>
</body>
```

**Main Content CSS:**
Add this to your **css/styles.css** file:

```css
/* Main Content Styles */
.main-content {
    min-height: calc(100vh - 200px);
    padding: 2rem 0;
